[en.FOCUS_C01_CORRECTING_HISTORY]
Correcting History

[en.FOCUS_C01_CORRECTING_HISTORY_desc]
The common ponies seem to have some incorrect memories about history, and their understanding should be corrected to fit into a correct and collective memory beneficial to the Empire.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_CORRECTING_HISTORY]
历史纠正

[zh.FOCUS_C01_CORRECTING_HISTORY_desc]
民间的小马们对于一些事情似乎持有错误的历史记忆，应该修正他们的认知，重塑正确的、对帝国有利的集体历史记忆。

